flowchart TD
    A[User] -->|Selects exercise + captures photo| B[Streamlit UI - app.py]
    B -->|st.form submission| C[prompts.py]
    C -->|Builds exercise-specific system prompt via f-string| D[gemini_client.py]
    D -->|Sends image + prompt| E[Gemini Vision API - gemini-3.6-flash]
    E -->|Returns raw JSON text| D
    D -->|Strips markdown fences, isolates JSON block| F[_extract_json]
    F -->|Parses + validates schema| G[Pydantic FormAnalysis model]
    G -->|On validation failure| H{Retry? max 2 attempts}
    H -->|Yes| D
    H -->|No - exhausted retries| I[GeminiParseError surfaced as friendly message]
    G -->|On success| J[st.session_state history]
    J -->|Appends attempt, keeps last 3| B
    B -->|Renders| K[st.metric KPI cards with deltas]
    B -->|Renders| L[st.data_editor flaw table]
    B -->|Renders| M[st.expander detailed notes]

    style E fill:#4285F4,color:#fff
    style G fill:#34A853,color:#fff
    style I fill:#EA4335,color:#fff
